# Code owners: these users are automatically requested for review.
#
# claude[bot] is the Claude GitHub App — it performs automated PR reviews
# via the claude-review workflow, and its approval satisfies branch
# protection. Code-owner approval is not required (the owner usually
# authors these PRs and cannot approve them); the request makes sure a
# human sees changes to the files below.
#
# Both maintainers own .github/, CLAUDE.md and .secrets.baseline, so the
# one who did not open the PR is requested automatically. A PR that edits
# the review workflow itself gets no Claude review and needs that second
# maintainer's approval. (A push ruleset restricting these paths is not
# available on public repos.)

